# --- dotf spec review artifacts (machine logs, not spec contract) ---------------------
# `dotf spec review` writes the reviewer transcript beside the spec it reviewed.
# `review.md` stays tracked on purpose: it is the signed artifact the archive
# gate reads. Everything below is reproducible noise, ~3.6 MB for two specs, and
# a `git add -A` in a session that just ran a review would otherwise commit it.
# .pr_agent.toml declares the same pattern under [ignore] for the same reason.
# Found by the CI-314 adversarial review (Minor).
specs/**/review-transcript.jsonl
specs/**/review-transcript.jsonl.stderr
specs/**/review-request.json
mutation-report.json
